{"id":"n52632-1-7","stage":4,"title":"뒤덮다 · 覆盖","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52632-1-7-1","ko":"먹구름이 하늘을 뒤덮고 있네.","zh":"乌云把天空都遮住了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"먹구름이","meaning":"乌云","explanation":"먹구름：乌云；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"먹구름","audio":"/audio/fe2ed8aa706e9bbeb4ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54805","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹구름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹구름이","audio":"/audio/c0d7a73fa6598648cc4f.mp3"}},{"text":"하늘을","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘을","audio":"/audio/2a06f55873889f6f0e04.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤덮고","meaning":"覆盖，笼罩","explanation":"뒤덮다：覆盖，笼罩；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뒤덮다","audio":"/audio/77f358d21d69aab41927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52632","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤덮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤덮고","audio":"/audio/b483b01d033cdc619e28.mp3"}},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네","audio":"/audio/a43e47a1fb823079c63a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe2ed8aa706e9bbe","term":"먹구름","zh":"乌云","audio":"/audio/fe2ed8aa706e9bbeb4ad.mp3","entryId":"54805","definition":"即将下雨或下雪时出现的黑云。","pronunciation":["먹꾸름"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"77f358d21d69aab4","term":"뒤덮다","zh":"覆盖，笼罩","audio":"/audio/77f358d21d69aab41927.mp3","entryId":"52632","definition":"全部遮盖，没有空的地方。","pronunciation"